Score one point for Team RGRN :-)

Very little of interest or style marks in this one. Early bones (thanks,
yaws) gave me a CoMR, Sokoban gave me AoR, general store gave me BoH
(and an oilskin sack). Minetown was coaligned and some saccing gave me
Sickersee and then Frosty. Stopped saccing for artifacts at this
point.

After all that, it really wasn't too hard. A perfectly normal combat
wombat ascension, with three screwups and one major worry along the
way:

* Jumping into the pool yaws had created on their bones level (Oracle),
  thus blanking my early stash of scrolls :-(
* (The big one): just before going to wake the Wizard, went back to my
  stash for a big alchemy session. Had previously locked all the watch
  in various rooms, but they still got annoyed by me drying up a
  fountain. When I came back, a giant had broken down the door to the
  watch captain's room, and he followed me into my stash (unfortunately,
  not in a chest). At which point he proceeded to pick up a wand of
  striking and zap it at me, standing on my stash. "34 blessed potions
  called water shatter" (and lots of other things).
* The above led to a major hack and slash in Gehennom looking for more
  potions (of which I was already fairly short due to Frosty). Happily
  magic trap #sitting when a cockatrice came along, so I picked up the
  rubber chicken and prepared to whack people with it. Unfortunately,
  a succubus had removed my gloves a few turns before hand. This is why
  you wear an AoLS, after all...

And the major worry:

* Happily hacking my way through the Sanctum, when a purple & appears. I
  wonder "what's that?". One quick ; check later reveals "& a major demon
  (Demogorgon)" and I'm scared. Watch Demo splat the priest of Moloch
  and nick the Amulet.

  Stop and think about what to do.

  Get out the WoW and wish for 2 blessed cockatrice eggs. Hit Demo.
  Break statue, get amulet and run like crazy.

The mysterious force was most annoying on the way up, but after that
things were easy.

Final stats were level 29, 469 HP, AC -31 and 5137688 points (my highest
score by a long way, but mainly due to that hack'n'slash session). No
interesting conducts (polyselfless, artifactwishless). Genocided h, L
and ; (the last on the Plane of Water).

